fixture hazard_breaks_the_charge_hold
doc Task 6 core review 2, M3 (lead decision); docs/adr/0013 The Charged strike: a hazard's send-back breaks the hold as a death does. Attack held from 0 while Ash falls onto the spikes and is sent back to safe ground; let go there 30 frames later: no Charged strike.
room test/spikes
spawn 600 60
frames 90
input
  0..59 attack
end
expect
  mark sent 1..40 event.hazard=1
  at sent charge_held=0
  at sent+1 charge_held=0
  never 0..89 event.charge_release=1
  never 0..89 action=charged
end
